        <mxCell id="rules" value="KEY RULES&#10;Only full Admin accounts manage users. A new Admin has separate credentials and personal settings.&#10;The built-in Admin, signed-in account and last full Admin are protected by current safeguards.&#10;Deletion eligibility and retained history are enforced by the server; direct requests cannot bypass them." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontColor=#273142;fontFamily=Montserrat;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
